{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17824","headline":"寄申州卢拱使君 · 杨巨源","name":"寄申州卢拱使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"领郡仍闻总虎貔，致身还是见男儿。\n小船隔水催桃叶，大鼓当风舞柘枝。\n酒坐微酣诸客倒，球场慢拨几人随。\n从来乐事憎诗苦，莫放窗中远岫知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}